<title>USA: CenterPoint Properties Corp Q3 net up.</title>
<headline>CenterPoint Properties Corp Q3 net up.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.33		    $0.17</p>
<p> Net			  5,358		    1,682</p>
<p> Revs			15,687		   11,549</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  16,483		    9,653</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 1996 net funds from operations (FFO) $0.48 per fully diluted share vs $0.43. New FFO is equal to net income before extraordinary items plus depreciation and amortization less amortization of deferred financing costs.  </p>
<p>Table reflects average primary shares outstanding. Q3 1996 fully diluted shares outstanding 17,334,095 vs 11,670,233.</p>
<p>		     NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.79		    $0.55</p>
<p> Net			 11,169		    4,976</p>
<p> Revs			44,067		   33,379</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  14,095		    8,992</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Nine-month 1996 net income after $1,430,000 or $0.10 a share charge for early extinguishment of debt.</p>
<p>Nine-month 1996 FFO $1.42 per fully diluted share vs $1.26.</p>
<p>Nine-month 1996 fully diluted shares outstanding 15,062,109 vs 11,263,550.</p>
